2026-09-16T15:03:28.976738Z [] {'tender_id': None, 'source_reference_id': 'https://www.tenders.gov.au/Atm/Show/fa8d0d11-f7c0-4034-9728-f1d819ad1fb5', 'source_id': 'DIG-ICD-IDT-01', 'title': 'Industry Briefing: Defence Intelligence Target Enterprise', 'issuing_agency': 'Department of Defence - ISG', 'category': 'Industry Briefing', 'status': 'open', 'publish_date': '2026-09-11', 'closing_date': '2026-09-21', 'value_amount': None, 'value_currency': None, 'value_notes': None, 'location': 'ACT, Canberra', 'description': "The Department of Defence - ISG is holding a classified industry briefing to outline the Defence Intelligence Target Enterprise and identify areas for industry contribution. The briefing will detail the Defence Targeting Enterprise and its supporting program, which includes projects such as Intelligence Mission Data (IMD) uplift.\n\nThis is an industry briefing, not a live tender, published on 11 September 2026. The briefing will take place in Canberra during the week commencing 28 September 2026. Organisations interested in attending must register by 4:30 pm ACT Local Time on 21 September 2026.\n\nDue to the classified nature of the briefing, attendees must hold a minimum Negative Vetting 1 (NV1) security clearance. Registration requires emailing dig.industry@defence.gov.au with the nominated attendees' name, date of birth, place of birth, and security clearance details. Each organisation is limited to two attendees.", 'contact_name': None, 'contact_email': 'dig.industry@defence.gov.au', 'contact_phone': None, 'lodgment_address': 'dig.industry@defence.gov.au', 'documents': [{'file_name': 'DIG-ICD-IDT-01.txt', 'extracted_text': "================================================================================\nAUSTENDER DETAILS: Current ATM View - DIG-ICD-IDT-01\n================================================================================\n\nDetail URL: https://www.tenders.gov.au/Atm/Show/fa8d0d11-f7c0-4034-9728-f1d819ad1fb5\nScraped At: 2026-09-16 15:02:06\n\nSTRUCTURED ATTRIBUTES:\n----------------------------------------\nATM ID: DIG-ICD-IDT-01\nAgency: Department of Defence - ISG\nCategory: 81112000 - Data services\nClose Date & Time: 21-Sep-2026 4:30 pm (ACT Local Time) Show close time for other time zones\nPublish Date: 11-Sep-2026\nLocation: ACT\nATM Type: Industry Briefing\nMulti Agency Access: No\nPanel Arrangement: No\nMulti-stage: No\nDescription: Defence has an ongoing need for industry contribution to the Defence Intelligence Target Enterprise.\xa0 Defence is holding a classified industry briefing to provide industry with an overview of the Enterprise and an indication of where Defence considers industry could contribute. The briefing will outline Defence's views on both the Defence Targeting Enterprise and the Targeting Program that supports it; the latter describing the various Defence projects that make up the Targeting Program, such as Intelligence Mission Data (IMD) uplift and others. The briefing will be held in Canberra in the week commencing 28 September 2026. Depending on interest, a number of briefings may be held. Industry organisations with an interest in this opportunity are encouraged to register.\nOther Instructions: As the briefing is classified, attendees are required to hold a minimum Negative Vetting 1 (NV1) clearance. To register\xa0 interest in attending the briefing please email dig.industry@defence.gov.au NLT 1630 AEST on 21 September 2026 with the name, date of birth, place of birth and security clearance of the nominated attendees.\xa0 Attendees are limited to two per organisation.\nConditions for Participation: Nil\nTimeframe for Delivery: N/A\nAddress for Lodgement: dig.industry@defence.gov.au\n\n================================================================================\n"}], 'content_hash': None, 'tags': None, 'first_seen_at': None, 'last_scanned_at': '2026-09-16T15:03:28.976080+00:00', 'updated_at': None, 'raw_extra': '{"tags": ["IT & software"]}'}
