2026-09-16T15:03:37.766711Z [] {'tender_id': None, 'source_reference_id': None, 'source_id': None, 'title': None, 'issuing_agency': None, 'category': None, 'status': None, 'publish_date': None, 'closing_date': None, 'value_amount': None, 'value_currency': None, 'value_notes': None, 'location': None, 'description': '', 'contact_name': None, 'contact_email': None, 'contact_phone': None, 'lodgment_address': None, 'documents': [{'file_name': 'EWPNOTICE 02_2026 Industry Notice Addendum 01.txt', 'extracted_text': 'Department of Defence\nIndustry Notice (IN) FOR \nEstate Works Program Defence Industry Update\n02/2026\nATM ID: EWPNOTICE 02/2026\nAddendum 01\nDate\nThis Addendum Number 01 is dated 11 August 2026.\nBackground\nThe Commonwealth of Australia, represented by the Department of Defence (Defence), issued an Industry Notice (IN) on 28 July 2026.\nContact Details\nThe Contact Details for this addendum is as follows:\nName: Directorate of Estate Works Program Office\nEmail: segservicedelivery.esddewpo@defence.gov.au \nUpdate to Industry Briefing Venue Information\nDefence advises that venue details for the Sydney, Melbourne and Townsville sessions of the 2026 Defence Estate Works Program Industry Briefings have now been confirmed.\nInterested parties are advised that the Defence event website has been updated with the confirmed venue information and should be consulted for the latest details regarding briefing locations, dates and event registration:\nhttps://www.defence.gov.au/business-industry/training-events/2026-defence-estate-works-program-industry-briefings \n'}, {'file_name': 'EWPNOTICE 02_2026.txt', 'extracted_text': "================================================================================\nAUSTENDER DETAILS: Current ATM View - EWPNOTICE 02/2026\n================================================================================\n\nDetail URL: https://www.tenders.gov.au/Atm/Show/abf897be-b902-4ab1-963e-64084e82b6df\nScraped At: 2026-09-16 15:02:07\n\nSTRUCTURED ATTRIBUTES:\n----------------------------------------\nATM ID: EWPNOTICE 02/2026\nAgency: Department of Defence - DSRG\nCategory: 72100000 - Building construction and support and maintenance and repair services\nClose Date & Time: 22-Sep-2026 12:00 pm (ACT Local Time) Show close time for other time zones\nPublish Date: 28-Jul-2026\nLocation: ACT, NSW, VIC, SA, WA, QLD, NT\nATM Type: Notice\nMulti Agency Access: No\nPanel Arrangement: No\nMulti-stage: No\nDescription: Department of Defence, Security and Estate Group advise industry that the Estate Works Program Office will be hosting Industry Briefings from early August to end September 2026. All Industry Briefings details are published on the Defence Internet page via the ?Industry training and events' page located in the ?Business and Industry' menu, or via the following address: https://www.defence.gov.au/business-industry/training-events/2026-defence-estate-works-program-industry-briefings The current Estate Works Program Tender Forecast is published on the Defence Internet, under the ?Business and Industry? > ?Finding Opportunities? > ?Estate Works Program Tender Forecast? page, or via the following link: https://www.defence.gov.au/business-industry/finding-opportunities/estate-works-program-tender-forecast\nOther Instructions: None applicable\nConditions for Participation: None applicable\nTimeframe for Delivery: None applicable\nAddress for Lodgement: None applicable\nAddenda Available: View Addenda\n\n================================================================================\n"}, {'file_name': 'SEG - EWP Industry Briefing - EWPNotice 02_2026 - July 2026.txt', 'extracted_text': "Department of Defence\nIndustry Notice\nIndustry Notice (IN) FOR \nEstate Works Program \nNational Industry Briefings\n02/2026\nATM ID: EWPNOTICE 02/2026\nDate\nThis Industry Notice EWPNOTICE 02/2026 is dated 28 July 2026.\nBackground\nIn support of ongoing engagement with industry, this notice is to advise that the Estate Works Program will be holding Industry Briefings at all major capital cities of Australia. \nContact Details\nThe Contact Details for this Notice is as follows:\nName: Directorate of Estate Works Program Office\nEmail: segservicedelivery.esddewpo@defence.gov.au \nIndustry Notice\nEstate Works Program Industry Briefings\nDepartment of Defence, Security and Estate Group advises industry that the Defence Estate Works Program Office will be hosting a series of Industry Briefings from early August 2026 to end September 2026. \nThese briefings provide an opportunity for industry participants to learn about the Defence Estate Works Program, identify future opportunities, and understand best-practice tendering approaches. The sessions will also provide guidance on engaging with Defence and successfully meeting contractual and delivery obligations.\nThe Briefings will be conducted in each major capital city. \nAll Industry Briefings details are published on the Defence Internet page via the ?Industry training and events' page located in the ?Business and Industry' menu. The event page contains information on briefing locations, dates, venues, registration requirements and any event updates. The full event details are available at the following link:\n2026 Defence Estate Works Program industry briefings | Defence\nThe event page will be maintained as the authoritative source of information for the EWP industry briefing sessions. Industry participants are encouraged to check the page for updates and changes to event arrangements. Updates will also be communicated through AusTender via addenda to this Industry Notice and when amendments to the event information published on the Defence website has occurred.\n*\tPlease note that, at the time of publication of this Industry Notice, details for some Estate Works Program (EWP) industry briefing locations have not yet been finalised. Updated information will be published on the event page as it becomes available.\nHow to Register\nAttendance to the industry briefing is in-person only.\nRegistration for the Defence Estate Works Program Industry Briefings is available via the link below or by scanning the QR code.\nThe registration process requires the provision of:\nSelection of Briefing Event to be attended\nCompany Name\nPrimary Attendee Name\nPrimary Attendee Contact Details\nSecondary Attendee Name (if required)\nSecondary Attendee Contact Details (if required)\nPlease complete and submit registration form at least 5 business days prior to the date listed in schedule.\nFollowing registration a confirmation email will be issued prior to the event.\nTo Register click the link Defence Estate Works Program Industry Briefing Registration \nOR scan code\nTender Opportunities \nThe current Estate Works Program Tender Forecast is published on the Defence Internet, under the ?Business and Industry? > ?Finding Opportunities? > ?Estate Works Program Tender Forecast? page, or via the following link:\nhttps://www.defence.gov.au/business-industry/finding-opportunities/estate-works-program-tender-forecast\n"}], 'content_hash': None, 'tags': None, 'first_seen_at': None, 'last_scanned_at': '2026-09-16T15:03:37.765829+00:00', 'updated_at': None, 'raw_extra': None}
